dead `lastError` field and the `error` snapshot field (or document why it is\n  intentionally always undefined) so the API does not advertise data it never\n  provides.\n", "filePath": "/Users/joyo/.quest-worktrees/sheaf-chat_main_0000_sheaf_chat/.quest_tmp_issue_lasterror.md", "originalFile": null, "structuredPatch": [], "type": "create", "userModified": false}, "type": "user", "uuid": "cde68685-baa1-4221-a6bc-ac69f2f5d051"}, "provider_thread_id": "908a34fb-6e31-45a3-af16-dae436832fe2", "role": "polisher_reviewer", "schema_version": 1, "sequence": 885, "step": 31, "thread": "sheaf-chat_main_0000_sheaf_chat_quest_0000_slice_0005_polisher_reviewer", "timestamp": "2026-06-08T22:16:23Z"}
